      "roundness": null,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "RELIABLE\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n1. Co-Authored-By trailer in commit body\n   'Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>'\n   \u2192 parseable from git log --format=%B\n   \u2192 strong signal: AI explicitly co-authored\n   \u2192 present in rocky commits, copilot commits\n\n2. No-diff entry (only in prompt log, never in diff)\n   \u2192 definitively ai_prompt\n   \u2192 topic in .rocky but no matching git diff",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "jidknwi5",
      "originalText": "RELIABLE\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n1. Co-Authored-By trailer in commit body\n   'Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>'\n   \u2192 parseable from git log --format=%B\n   \u2192 strong signal: AI explicitly co-authored\n   \u2192 present in rocky commits, copilot commits\n\n2. No-diff entry (only in prompt log, never in diff)\n   \u2192 definitively ai_prompt\n   \u2192 topic in .rocky but no matching git diff",
      "lineHeight": 1.4
    },
