      "roundness": null,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "MODERATE\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n3. Prompt log proximity\n   Prompt about topic X within ~hours of\n   a commit introducing topic X\n   \u2192 correlation, not causation\n   \u2192 requires .rocky log to predate commit\n\n4. Diff velocity\n   >500 lines / >10 files in one commit\n   \u2192 unusual for solo hand-writing\n   \u2192 weak alone, adds weight to other signals",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "la8s8hmb",
      "originalText": "MODERATE\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n3. Prompt log proximity\n   Prompt about topic X within ~hours of\n   a commit introducing topic X\n   \u2192 correlation, not causation\n   \u2192 requires .rocky log to predate commit\n\n4. Diff velocity\n   >500 lines / >10 files in one commit\n   \u2192 unusual for solo hand-writing\n   \u2192 weak alone, adds weight to other signals",
      "lineHeight": 1.4
    },
