      "locked": false,
      "text": "UNRELIABLE  \u2717\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n\u2717 Commit authorship  (disproved above)\n\n\u2717 Commit message style\n  Claude writes 'feat:' / 'fix:' but so do\n  disciplined human devs\n\n\u2717 Code quality / cleanliness\n  AI writes clean code; so do good devs\n\n\u2717 File count / change size alone\n  Refactors can be large and hand-written",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "01nouhtc",
      "originalText": "UNRELIABLE  \u2717\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\n\u2717 Commit authorship  (disproved above)\n\n\u2717 Commit message style\n  Claude writes 'feat:' / 'fix:' but so do\n  disciplined human devs\n\n\u2717 Code quality / cleanliness\n  AI writes clean code; so do good devs\n\n\u2717 File count / change size alone\n  Refactors can be large and hand-written",
      "lineHeight": 1.4
    },
    {
      "id": "2m71hssb",
