      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "\ud83d\udcdd OPEN QUESTIONS \u2014 annotate with your decisions:\n\n1. Should co_authored lower initial stability, or just flag it in the UI?\n2. What's the minimum clean_pass_count before a topic is considered 'independently understood'?\n3. For topics predating this feature \u2014 can we infer source from git log Co-Authored-By retroactively?\n4. Should task_prompt be treated the same as ai_prompt, or differently?\n5. When prompted + committed (most common case) \u2014 does co_authored flag = true win, or does diff presence win?",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "yar821uz",
      "originalText": "\ud83d\udcdd OPEN QUESTIONS \u2014 annotate with your decisions:\n\n1. Should co_authored lower initial stability, or just flag it in the UI?\n2. What's the minimum clean_pass_count before a topic is considered 'independently understood'?\n3. For topics predating this feature \u2014 can we infer source from git log Co-Authored-By retroactively?\n4. Should task_prompt be treated the same as ai_prompt, or differently?\n5. When prompted + committed (most common case) \u2014 does co_authored flag = true win, or does diff presence win?",
      "lineHeight": 1.4
    }
  ],
